@startuml Vista de Processos - Level 4 (US 2.2.7 - Get Pending Visits)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Port Authority Officer" as Officer
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisualization (UI)\nController" as UI_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "<<container (C4)>>\nVisits & Manifests\nController" as MDR_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "<<component>>\nApplication Service" as MDR_APP #87CEEB
participant "<<component>>\nRepository" as MDR_REPO #87CEEB
participant "<<component>>\nData Model" as MDR_DATA #87CEEB
participant "<<component>>\nPersistence" as MDR_PERSIST #87CEEB

activate Officer
Officer -> UI_CTRL: 1: GET /api/vessel-visits/notifications?status=Submitted
activate UI_CTRL
UI_CTRL -> MDR_CTRL: 1.1: getAll(status=Submitted)
activate MDR_CTRL
MDR_CTRL -> MDR_APP: 1.1.1: getFiltered(filter{Status=Submitted})
activate MDR_APP

MDR_APP -> MDR_REPO: 1.1.1.1: getFilteredAsync(imo=null, status=Submitted, dateFrom?, dateTo?, repId?, orgId?)
activate MDR_REPO
MDR_REPO -> MDR_PERSIST: 1.1.1.1.1: query VesselVisitNotifications where Status = Submitted
activate MDR_PERSIST
MDR_PERSIST --> MDR_REPO: 1.1.1.1.2: list of records
deactivate MDR_PERSIST
MDR_REPO -> MDR_DATA: 1.1.1.1.3: map to domain
activate MDR_DATA
MDR_DATA --> MDR_REPO: 1.1.1.1.4: list of aggregates
deactivate MDR_DATA
MDR_REPO --> MDR_APP: 1.1.1.1.5: vvns
deactivate MDR_REPO

MDR_APP -> MDR_APP: map to VesselVisitNotificationDTO list
MDR_APP --> MDR_CTRL: 1.1.2: list<VesselVisitNotificationDTO>
deactivate MDR_APP
MDR_CTRL --> UI_CTRL: 1.2: HTTP 200 OK [pending visits]
deactivate MDR_CTRL
UI_CTRL --> Officer: 1.3: show pending visits (Submitted)
deactivate UI_CTRL
deactivate Officer

note right of MDR_APP
  Filtering rules:
  - Status fixed to Submitted
  - Other filters optional (ETA range, vessel IMO)
  - Returns DTOs for UI
end note

@enduml
